#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:865
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Text Import</interface> Druid used for "
"fixed width data"
msgstr ""
"Andra panelen i guiden <interface>Textimport</interface> för data med fast "
"bredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:870
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Text Import</interface> Druid used for "
"fixed width data allows the user to define the widths of each column to be "
"imported. <application>Gnumeric</application> provides a mechanism to "
"automatically guess the widths of the columns and allows the user, using the"
" mouse, to define the widths of the columns."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelen i guiden <interface>Textimport</interface> för data med "
"fast bredd anger du bredden på varje kolumn som ska importeras. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan försöka identifiera kolumnbredderna "
"automatiskt, men du kan också justera dem med musen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:880
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Text Import</interface> druid for fixed "
"width data with the component areas labeled with callouts."
msgstr ""
"Den andra panelen i guiden <interface>Textimport</interface> för data med "
"fast bredd, med delarna märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:892
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the second panel 'Text Import' druid for fixed width"
" data with callouts labeling the different areas."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar den andra panelen i textimportguiden för data med fast "
"bredd, med de olika områdena märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:899
msgid ""
"The different components of the second panel of the <interface>Text "
"Import</interface> druid for fixed width data with each component labeled "
"with a callout."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i den andra panelen i guiden "
"<interface>Textimport</interface> för data med fast bredd, alla märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:915
msgid "The components of the second panel for fixed width data"
msgstr "Delarna i den andra panelen för data med fast bredd"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:920
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> - The automatic column discovery "
"button."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> – Knappen för automatisk "
"kolumnidentifiering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:925
msgid ""
"This left most button, named <guibutton>Auto Column Discovery</guibutton>, "
"will cause <application>Gnumeric</application> to scan the file an attempt "
"to assign the columns automatically. The example presented in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-textImport-druid-panel2b\"/> shows one result after this "
"button has been pressed: many of the columns were discovered automatically, "
"but the second and third columns were misidentified. Nonetheless, the "
"automatic mechanism provides a useful starting point. The definition of the "
"columns can be refined using the methods described below."
msgstr ""
"Den här knappen längst till vänster, <guibutton>Automatisk "
"kolumnidentifiering</guibutton>, låter <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"läsa igenom filen och försöka hitta kolumnerna automatiskt. Exemplet i <xref"
" linkend=\"fig-file-textImport-druid-panel2b\"/> visar ett resultat: många "
"kolumner har hittats, men den andra och tredje har identifierats fel. "
"Funktionen ger ändå en användbar utgångspunkt. Du kan finjustera kolumnerna "
"med metoderna nedan."
